	"data": "Sesame Csm Voice Clone\n\nSesame CSM Voice Clone\n\nPersonal voice cloning setup using Sesame's CSM-1B model.\n\nSetup\nLocation: ~/Projects/csm\nEnvironment: Python venv with CSM dependencies\nModel: CSM-1B (~3.6GB VRAM load, requires ~5.7GB total free)\nPrompt audio: 10s extracted from Audacity project (411MB, ~40min total recording)\nTranscription: Whisper\n\nUsage\nRequired environment variable: NO_TORCH_COMPILE=1 (prevents Triton kernel compilation crash)\n\nBasic command:\n\nDefaults configured:\n--prompt…",
